{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every day, you get 100 games to try to win prizes at the island's Game Center.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All rewards earned are added to your inventory and you can either display them in your apartment or trade them with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also complete other quests or challenges with visitors to the island to increase your reputation level, improve the island's Game Center, unlock even more machines, expand your apartment, and own more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some examples of rewards: stickers, figurines, card boosters, clothing, furniture, swords, karts, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990170?t=1762189449","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990170/e955f95dc3104448c0e95fa9e4b6728aab0a6e5d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762189449","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990170/564113b783cd0d2563fbe81c4c7a512e703a012f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762189449","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990170/564113b783cd0d2563fbe81c4c7a512e703a012f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762189449","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every day, you get 100 games to try to win prizes at the island's Game Center.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All rewards earned are added to your inventory and you can either display them in your apartment or trade them w